00:26:20.646 --> 00:26:22.986
And, you know, but in high school,

00:26:22.986 --> 00:26:25.156
our band's name was Malignancy.

00:26:25.156 --> 00:26:26.686
It was a heavy metal band.

00:26:26.686 --> 00:26:28.839
We were enamored with names that sounded,

00:26:30.786 --> 00:26:32.026
I don't know,

00:26:32.026 --> 00:26:36.896
horrifying in some way
or yeah, but that was it.

00:26:36.896 --> 00:26:38.216
We actually changed the name,

00:26:38.216 --> 00:26:39.786
or we were nameless for a while

00:26:39.786 --> 00:26:40.986
'cause there was some
other band named that.

00:26:40.986 --> 00:26:43.876
It was, we, you know, I was on one side

00:26:43.876 --> 00:26:46.586
this very curious, academic
kid but there was a side,

00:26:46.586 --> 00:26:48.826
I was a little bit angsty and angry.

00:26:48.826 --> 00:26:53.816
And so, I was drawn at that age to fairly

00:26:53.816 --> 00:26:57.526
extreme heavy metal and
