But, you know, there was a weekend

00:27:01.806 --> 00:27:04.630
where I had to pick between
going to National Academic Games

00:27:04.630 --> 00:27:08.076
and performing with our band,
which was our first gig.

00:27:08.076 --> 00:27:12.446
I think we were going to open
