that are also the volunteer
tutors and actually some of them

00:31:47.256 --> 00:31:50.906
are some of the really
good tutors out there.

00:31:50.906 --> 00:31:52.896
So, you can also volunteer
and you can do both.

00:31:52.896 --> 00:31:55.206
Right now as I mentioned, it's
starting in high school math.

00:31:55.206 --> 00:31:56.476
But if you're at all interested in it,

00:31:56.476 --> 00:31:59.476
I would go and register and
we're gonna notify people

00:31:59.476 --> 00:32:02.036
over time because we're,
you know, there's no reason

00:32:02.036 --> 00:32:04.476
why we can't expand to other subjects

00:32:04.476 --> 00:32:05.386
and other grade levels.

00:32:05.386 --> 00:32:06.306
So, we're gonna be doing that

00:32:06.306 --> 00:32:08.446
probably over the next month or so.

00:32:08.446 --> 00:32:10.796
We're gonna be adding a bunch
of more grade levels on,

00:32:10.796 --> 00:32:14.646
so whether you wanna be a tutor
in say English on the SAT,

00:32:14.646 --> 00:32:16.906
or a tutor young kids learning math

00:32:16.906 --> 00:32:19.066
or you wanna be the
recipient of the tutoring,

00:32:19.066 --> 00:32:21.366
I encourage folks to go to
Schoolhouse.world, sign up.

00:32:21.366 --> 00:32:24.076
As I mentioned, we actually
are looking for more students.

00:32:24.076 --> 00:32:25.706
We can easily handle

00:32:25.706 --> 00:32:27.906
several thousand more students right now.

00:32:27.906 --> 00:32:29.816
And obviously if anyone's
interested in tutoring,

00:32:29.816 --> 00:32:33.256
that's great too, because we
can handle even more students.

00:32:33.256 --> 00:32:35.256
And, you know, the dream
here is and this is...

00:32:35.256 --> 00:32:37.086
COVID was the catalyst
to make this happen.

00:32:37.086 --> 00:32:39.216
But, the dream here is that in short order

00:32:39.216 --> 00:32:41.466
we have tens of thousands or
hundreds of thousands of folks

00:32:41.466 --> 00:32:42.486
who are able to help each other,

00:32:42.486 --> 00:32:45.076
which obviously has the
benefit where you can learn

00:32:45.076 --> 00:32:46.556
at your own time and pace on Khan Academy,

00:32:46.556 --> 00:32:48.176
but you can get real live help.

00:32:48.176 --> 00:32:49.696
But, in this time of social distancing,

00:32:49.696 --> 00:32:51.546
hopefully they can connect people,

00:32:51.546 --> 00:32:54.036
they can build empathy for other folks.

00:32:54.036 --> 00:32:55.626
You know, when you become a tutor,

00:32:55.626 --> 00:32:57.776
you learn the material that much better.

00:32:57.776 --> 00:33:02.776
And, you're helping folks
and you're building empathy

00:33:03.516 --> 00:33:04.476
and communication skills.

00:33:04.476 --> 00:33:06.356
So, encourage folks to
check out Schoolhouse.world

00:33:06.356 --> 00:33:08.306
and all the other stuff
we're doing at Khan Academy.

00:33:08.306 --> 00:33:09.426
Schoolhouse.world just remember,

00:33:09.426 --> 00:33:11.516
it's not officially a
Khan Academy project.

00:33:11.516 --> 00:33:13.136
It's a Sal project.

00:33:13.136 --> 00:33:14.486
Who knows, maybe they might converge

00:33:14.486 --> 00:33:15.766
at some point in the future.

00:33:15.766 --> 00:33:19.526
So anyway, time always goes
by fast when we're having fun.

00:33:19.526 --> 00:33:22.726
Maybe I'll have the guitar
next to me next time.

00:33:22.726 --> 00:33:25.076
But, it was really really good questions

00:33:25.076 --> 00:33:26.366
and thanks everyone for asking them.

00:33:26.366 --> 00:33:28.426
I think we're not doing this tomorrow,

00:33:28.426 --> 00:33:31.226
